        "text": "Passed/agreed to in House: On motion to suspend the rules and agree to the resolution Agreed to by the Yeas and Nays: (2/3 required): 418 - 2 (Roll no. 162).",
        "type": "Floor"
      },
      {
        "action_date": "2026-05-13",
        "text": "Considered as unfinished business. (consideration: CR H3420-3421)",
